      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Featured publication title and evidence link; supplied images remain separate assets.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-science\"><h3>Isomeric Indole-Chalcone Surrogates as Complementary Reporters of Nucleic Acid Binding Thermodynamics</h3><a class=\"ds-focus\" href=\"publications.html\">View publication</a></article>",
      "css": ".ds-science{color:var(--ink,#253b34);background:var(--paper,#ffffff)}.ds-science h3{font:400 clamp(28px,2.5vw,36px)/1.16 var(--serif,'Newsreader',Georgia,serif);letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ds-science a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px;margin-top:14px;color:var(--blue,#315e4b);font:600 14px/1.62 var(--sans,'DM Sans','Segoe UI',sans-serif);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:6px}.ds-science a:hover{color:var(--blue,#315e4b)}.ds-focus:focus-visible{outline:3px solid rgba(24,91,95,.34);outline-offset:3px}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-science h3{font-size:29px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Molecular Structures",
      "kind": "custom",
